---
export const title = 'Usage';
export const order = 100;
import DemoComponentCard from '../../../../components/DemoComponentCard.astro';
---
<p>
  <strong><code>wc-notification</code> is deprecated</strong> and will be removed in 4.0; it logs a console
  warning once per page. It overlapped two components, so use the one that fits:
</p>
<ul>
  <li><a href='/components/alert'><code>wc-alert</code></a> for a message that is part of the page (it has
    <code>intent</code>, <code>dismissible</code> and an <code>action</code> slot).</li>
  <li><a href='/components/snackbar'><code>wc-snackbar</code></a> for one transient toast, or
    <a href='/components/notification-manager'><code>wc-notification-manager</code></a> for a queue of them.</li>
</ul>

<p>Use notifications to surface concise status updates and next steps without interrupting the flow.</p>

<DemoComponentCard lang={'html'}>
  <wc-notification dismissible action='View details'>
    <span slot='title'>Backup completed</span>
    <span slot='subtitle'>All files were saved to cloud storage.</span>
  </wc-notification>
</DemoComponentCard>
